<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Title II Reports</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        th, td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
        .section-heading { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .sub-heading { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .data-label { font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 150px; }
    </style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td, th { padding: 8px 0; text-align: left; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">title<span style="font-size: 24pt;">ii</span></div>
                <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">highereducationact</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
                <button style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #0056b3; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer;">VIEW TITLE II REPORTS</button>
                <button style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer;">SUBMIT REPORTS</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>About Title II</div>
            <div>Contacts</div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">{{ institution_name }}</div>
            <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">2015</div>
            <div>Title II Reports</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Complete Report Card</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">AY {{ academic_year }}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Institution Information</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>Name of Institution: <span data-field="institution.name">{{ institution.name }}</span></p>
            <p>Institution/Program Type: <span data-field="institution.program_type">{{ institution.program_type }}</span></p>
            <p>Academic Year: <span data-field="institution.academic_year">{{ institution.academic_year }}</span></p>
            <p>State: <span data-field="institution.state">{{ institution.state }}</span></p>
            <p>Address: <span data-field="institution.address">{{ institution.address }}</span></p>
            <p>Contact Name: <span data-field="institution.contact_name">{{ institution.contact_name }}</span></p>
            <p>Phone: <span data-field="institution.phone">{{ institution.phone }}</span></p>
            <p>Email: <span data-field="institution.email">{{ institution.email }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>Is your institution a member of an HEA Title II Teacher Quality Partnership (TQP) grant awarded by the U.S. Department of Education? <span data-field="is_tqp_member">{{ is_tqp_member }}</span></p>
            <p>No</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>If yes, provide the following:</p>
            <p>Award year: <span data-field="award_year">{{ award_year }}</span></p>
            <p>Grantee name: <span data-field="grantee_name">{{ grantee_name }}</span></p>
            <p>Project name: <span data-field="project_name">{{ project_name }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>Grant number: <span data-field="grant_number">{{ grant_number }}</span></p>
            <p>List partner districts/LEAs: <span data-field="partner_districts_leas">{{ partner_districts_leas }}</span></p>
            <p>List other partners: <span data-field="other_partners">{{ other_partners }}</span></p>
            <p>Project Type: <span data-field="project_type">{{ project_type }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Section I.a Program Information</div>
        <p>List each teacher preparation program included in your traditional route. Indicate if your program or programs participate in a Teacher Quality Partnership Grant awarded by the U.S. Department of Education as described at <a href="http://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/toiqp/index.html">http://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/toiqp/index.html</a>.</p>
        
        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 70%;">Teacher Preparation Programs</th>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">Teacher Quality Partnership Grant Member?</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for program in teacher_prep_programs %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="teacher_prep_programs[{{ loop.index0 }}].program_name">{{ program.program_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="teacher_prep_programs[{{ loop.index0 }}].is_tqp_member">{{ program.is_tqp_member }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>Total number of teacher preparation programs: <span data-field="total_programs">{{ total_programs }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Section I.b Admissions</div>
        <p>Indicate when students are formally admitted into your initial teacher certification program:</p>
        <p>Sophomore year: <span data-field="admissions_sophomore_year">{{ admissions_sophomore_year }}</span></p>
        <p>Does your initial teacher certification program conditionally admit students? <span data-field="conditionally_admit_students">{{ conditionally_admit_students }}</span></p>
        <p>Provide a link to your website where additional information about admissions requirements can be found: <span data-field="admissions_website_link">{{ admissions_website_link }}</span></p>
        <p>Please provide any additional comments about or exceptions to the admissions information provided above:</p>
        <p><span data-field="admissions_comments">{{ admissions_comments }}</span></p>

        <div class="sub-heading">Section I.b Undergraduate Requirements</div>
        <p>Please provide the following information about your teacher preparation program's entry and exit requirements. (<a href="https://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/toiqp/index.html">S205(a)(1)(C)(i)</a>)</p>
        <p>Are there initial teacher certification programs at the undergraduate level? <span data-field="undergrad_programs_exist">{{ undergrad_programs_exist }}</span></p>

        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Element</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Entry</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Exit</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Transcript</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.transcript_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.transcript_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.transcript_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.transcript_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Fingerprint check</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.fingerprint_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.fingerprint_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.fingerprint_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.fingerprint_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Background check</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.background_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.background_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.background_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.background_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum number of courses/credits/semester hours completed</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.min_courses_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.min_courses_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.min_courses_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.min_courses_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum GPA</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.min_gpa_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.min_gpa_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.min_gpa_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.min_gpa_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum GPA in content area coursework</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.gpa_content_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.gpa_content_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.gpa_content_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.gpa_content_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum GPA in professional education coursework</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.gpa_prof_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.gpa_prof_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.gpa_prof_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.gpa_prof_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum ACT score</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.act_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.act_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.act_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.act_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum SAT score</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.sat_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.sat_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.sat_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.sat_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum basic skills test score</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.basic_skills_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.basic_skills_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.basic_skills_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.basic_skills_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Subject area/academic content test or other subject matter verification</td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.subject_test_entry">{{ undergrad_requirements.subject_test_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="undergrad_requirements.subject_test_exit">{{ undergrad_requirements.subject_test_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>Recommendation(s):</p>
            <table style="width: 50%;">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 50%;">Element</th>
                        <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Entry</th>
                        <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Exit</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Essay or personal statement</td>
                        <td><span data-field="undergrad_recommendations.essay_entry">{{ undergrad_recommendations.essay_entry }}</span></td>
                        <td><span data-field="undergrad_recommendations.essay_exit">{{ undergrad_recommendations.essay_exit }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Interview</td>
                        <td><span data-field="undergrad_recommendations.interview_entry">{{ undergrad_recommendations.interview_entry }}</span></td>
                        <td><span data-field="undergrad_recommendations.interview_exit">{{ undergrad_recommendations.interview_exit }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Other Praxis II Content Exam</td>
                        <td><span data-field="undergrad_recommendations.praxis_other_entry">{{ undergrad_recommendations.praxis_other_entry }}</span></td>
                        <td><span data-field="undergrad_recommendations.praxis_other_exit">{{ undergrad_recommendations.praxis_other_exit }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>What is the minimum GPA required for admission into the program? <span data-field="min_gpa_admission">{{ min_gpa_admission }}</span></p>
            <p>What was the median GPA of individuals accepted into the program in academic year {{ academic_year }}? <span data-field="median_gpa_accepted">{{ median_gpa_accepted }}</span></p>
            <p>What is the minimum GPA required for completing the program? <span data-field="min_gpa_completion">{{ min_gpa_completion }}</span></p>
            <p>What was the median GPA of individuals completing the program in academic year {{ academic_year }}? <span data-field="median_gpa_completing">{{ median_gpa_completing }}</span></p>
            <p>Please provide any additional comments about the information provided above:</p>
            <p><span data-field="undergrad_additional_comments">{{ undergrad_additional_comments }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Section I.b Postgraduate Requirements</div>
        <p>Please provide the following information about your teacher preparation program's entry and exit requirements. (<a href="https://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/toiqp/index.html">S205(a)(1)(C)(i)</a>)</p>
        <p>Are there initial teacher certification programs at the postgraduate level? <span data-field="postgrad_programs_exist">{{ postgrad_programs_exist }}</span></p>

        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Element</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Entry</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Exit</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Transcript</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.transcript_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.transcript_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.transcript_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.transcript_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Fingerprint check</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.fingerprint_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.fingerprint_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.fingerprint_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.fingerprint_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Background check</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.background_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.background_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.background_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.background_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum number of courses/credits/semester hours completed</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.min_courses_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.min_courses_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.min_courses_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.min_courses_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum GPA</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.min_gpa_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.min_gpa_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.min_gpa_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.min_gpa_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum GPA in content area coursework</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.gpa_content_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.gpa_content_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.gpa_content_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.gpa_content_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum GPA in professional education coursework</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.gpa_prof_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.gpa_prof_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.gpa_prof_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.gpa_prof_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum ACT score</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.act_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.act_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.act_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.act_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum SAT score</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.sat_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.sat_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.sat_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.sat_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Minimum basic skills test score</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.basic_skills_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.basic_skills_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.basic_skills_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.basic_skills_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Subject area/academic content test or other subject matter verification</td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.subject_test_entry">{{ postgrad_requirements.subject_test_entry }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="postgrad_requirements.subject_test_exit">{{ postgrad_requirements.subject_test_exit }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>Recommendation(s):</p>
            <table style="width: 50%;">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 50%;">Element</th>
                        <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Entry</th>
                        <th style="width: 25%;">Required for Exit</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Essay or personal statement</td>
                        <td><span data-field="postgrad_recommendations.essay_entry">{{ postgrad_recommendations.essay_entry }}</span></td>
                        <td><span data-field="postgrad_recommendations.essay_exit">{{ postgrad_recommendations.essay_exit }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Interview</td>
                        <td><span data-field="postgrad_recommendations.interview_entry">{{ postgrad_recommendations.interview_entry }}</span></td>
                        <td><span data-field="postgrad_recommendations.interview_exit">{{ postgrad_recommendations.interview_exit }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Other Praxis II Content Exam</td>
                        <td><span data-field="postgrad_recommendations.praxis_other_entry">{{ postgrad_recommendations.praxis_other_entry }}</span></td>
                        <td><span data-field="postgrad_recommendations.praxis_other_exit">{{ postgrad_recommendations.praxis_other_exit }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>What is the minimum GPA required for admission into the program? <span data-field="min_gpa_postgrad_admission">{{ min_gpa_postgrad_admission }}</span></p>
            <p>What was the median GPA of individuals accepted into the program in academic year {{ academic_year }}? <span data-field="median_gpa_postgrad_accepted">{{ median_gpa_postgrad_accepted }}</span></p>
            <p>What is the minimum GPA required for completing the program? <span data-field="min_gpa_postgrad_completion">{{ min_gpa_postgrad_completion }}</span></p>
            <p>What was the median GPA of individuals completing the program in academic year {{ academic_year }}? <span data-field="median_gpa_postgrad_completing">{{ median_gpa_postgrad_completing }}</span></p>
            <p>Please provide any additional comments about the information provided above:</p>
            <p><span data-field="postgrad_additional_comments">{{ postgrad_additional_comments }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading">Section I.c Enrollment</div>
        <p>Provide the number of students in the teacher preparation program in the following categories. Note that you must report on the number of students by ethnicity and race separately. Individuals who are non-Hispanic/Latino will be reported in one of the race categories. Also note that individuals can belong to one or more racial groups, so the sum of the members of each racial category may not necessarily add up to the total number of students enrolled.</p>
        <p>For the purpose of Title II reporting, an enrolled student is defined as a student who has been admitted to a teacher preparation program, but who has not completed the program during the academic year being reported. An individual who completed the program during the academic year being reported is counted as a program completer and not an enrolled student.</p>
        <p>Additional guidance on reporting race and ethnicity data.</p>

        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">Ethnicity</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">2013-14</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%;">2014-15</th>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">Number enrolled</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Hispanic/Latino of any race:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_hispanic_2013_14">{{ enrollment_hispanic_2013_14 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_hispanic_2014_15">{{ enrollment_hispanic_2014_15 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_hispanic_total">{{ enrollment_hispanic_total }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>American Indian or Alaska Native:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_ai_2013_14">{{ enrollment_ai_2013_14 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_ai_2014_15">{{ enrollment_ai_2014_15 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_ai_total">{{ enrollment_ai_total }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Asian:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_asian_2013_14">{{ enrollment_asian_2013_14 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_asian_2014_15">{{ enrollment_asian_2014_15 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_asian_total">{{ enrollment_asian_total }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Black or African American:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_black_2013_14">{{ enrollment_black_2013_14 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_black_2014_15">{{ enrollment_black_2014_15 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_black_total">{{ enrollment_black_total }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_pacific_2013_14">{{ enrollment_pacific_2013_14 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_pacific_2014_15">{{ enrollment_pacific_2014_15 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="enrollment_pacific_total">{{ enrollment_pacific_total }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>White:</td>
